## Best Practices Checklist

### Code Quality
- [ ] SDK wrapper uses PIMPL pattern
- [ ] No SDK headers included outside wrapper implementation
- [ ] All SDK errors converted to `AlpacaException`
- [ ] Thread safety documented and handled
- [ ] Platform-specific code only in CMake
- [ ] Documentation comments for public API
- [ ] License header in all source files
- [ ] SDK version documented in comments

### CMake Configuration
- [ ] Vendor `CMakeLists.txt` created in `src/vendors/<vendor>/`
- [ ] Vendor `CMakeLists.txt` documents which SDK files are used
- [ ] Main `CMakeLists.txt` updated with option flag (Step 1)
- [ ] Main `CMakeLists.txt` updated in ENABLE_ALL_VENDORS block (Step 2)
- [ ] Main `CMakeLists.txt` updated with subdirectory inclusion (Step 3)
- [ ] Main `CMakeLists.txt` updated with installation rules (Step 4)

### Testing
- [ ] Unit tests for driver functionality
- [ ] Integration tests with hardware (if available)
- [ ] Error condition testing
