## Quick Reference

### File Locations

| Component | Location |
|-----------|----------|
| SDK Files | `external/<vendor_sdk_folder>/` (folder name varies by vendor) |
| Wrapper Header | `include/alpacacore/vendor/<vendor>/<vendor>_sdk_wrapper.h` |
| Wrapper Implementation | `src/vendors/<vendor>/<vendor>_sdk_wrapper.cpp` |
| Driver Implementation | `src/vendors/<vendor>/<vendor>_<device>_driver.cpp` |
| CMake Configuration | `src/vendors/<vendor>/CMakeLists.txt` |

### Build Commands

```bash
# Build with vendor support
cmake .. -DALPACACORE_ENABLE_ZWO=ON
cmake --build .

# Build with tests
cmake .. -DALPACACORE_ENABLE_ZWO=ON -DALPACACORE_BUILD_TESTS=ON
cmake --build .
ctest
```

### Namespace Convention

```cpp
namespace alpacacore::vendor::zwo {
    // ZWO-specific code
}

namespace alpacacore {
    // Core AlpacaCore code (no vendor dependencies)
}
```

